  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The project number 00080914 titled Management-UNDP-DJI used to receive and utilise development effectiveness resources which were used to cover the costs related to the salaries of the position related to the UNDP Djibouti Deputy Resident Representative. In 2022 UNDP Djibouti has discontinued this practice, and different resources are now being utilized to cover the costs associated with the UNDP Djibouti Deputy Resident Representative position. The project is now meant and used solely to cover</narrative>
